    skos:broader <https://github.com/jsboige/CoursIA/cursus/concept/208c3691-9b89-4645-8c82-9c6e84348403> ;
    skos:definition "Each job is given a due date; its lateness is its completion time minus its due date, negative when the job ends early, and its tardiness keeps only the positive part. The objective becomes the maximum lateness or the total tardiness, instead of the makespan or combined with it."@en,
        "Chaque job reçoit une échéance ; son retard algébrique (lateness) est sa date de fin moins son échéance, négatif quand le job finit en avance, et son retard (tardiness) n'en garde que la partie positive. L'objectif devient le retard algébrique maximal ou la somme des retards, à la place du makespan ou combiné à lui."@fr ;
    skos:inScheme <https://github.com/jsboige/CoursIA/cursus/scheme/search> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Due dates and lateness"@en,
        "Échéances et retard"@fr ;
    cursus:decimalPath "12.5" ;
    cursus:depth 1 ;
    cursus:hasCellCitation [ a cursus:CellCitation ;
