    skos:broader <https://github.com/jsboige/CoursIA/cursus/concept/0231500b-53f9-4e0a-8b55-1958f854f36d> ;
    skos:definition "A symmetric CSP has solutions that are images of one another under rotation or reflection, which the solver explores for nothing. Extra constraints discard these variants: on the notebook's 8-Queens, two constraints bring 92 solutions down to 35."@en,
        "Un CSP symétrique a des solutions images les unes des autres par rotation ou réflexion, que le solveur explore en pure perte. Des contraintes supplémentaires écartent ces variantes : sur les 8-Reines du carnet, deux contraintes ramènent 92 solutions à 35."@fr ;
    skos:inScheme <https://github.com/jsboige/CoursIA/cursus/scheme/search> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Symmetry breaking"@en,
        "Cassage de symétries"@fr ;
